      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "Anima Sampler Metadata reads the settings the KSampler actually used (profile applied) from its info output. Connect its outputs to an image-saver metadata node (e.g. Image Saver Metadata: seed_value, steps, cfg, sampler_name, scheduler_name, denoise). The previews here only show the values.\n\nThe Artist & Character Picker feeds Prompt Studio's artist / character inputs, which replace its inline ARTIST / CHAR fields (shown dimmed). Click a picker row to search; -/+ on each entry sets its prompt weight. AFTER RUN = randomize draws a new random artist each run."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "Anima Sampler Metadata reads the settings the KSampler actually used (profile applied) from its info output. Connect its outputs to an image-saver metadata node (e.g. Image Saver Metadata: seed_value, steps, cfg, sampler_name, scheduler_name, denoise). The previews here only show the values.\n\nThe Artist & Character Picker feeds Prompt Studio's artist / character inputs, which replace its inline ARTIST / CHAR fields (shown dimmed). Click a picker row to search; -/+ on each entry sets its prompt weight. AFTER RUN = randomize draws a new random artist each run."
      },
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    }
